#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1151 expect=noViolation domain=TI
#note "The blank TARGET is excluded from the group's distinct values and is never flagged, leaving one distinct non-blank short name."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TI label="Trial Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col IETESTCD type=Char
col IETEST   type=Char
col TIVERS   type=Char
---
S1 | TI | INCL01 | Age 18 years or older | 1
S1 | TI |         | Age 18 years or older | 1
